      {
        "id": "LockeQ",
        "name": "Ritual Nails",
        "description": "Locke readies a set of Soul Nails to throw, dealing damage to and marking enemies hit. Locke can consume the marks to deal bonus damage with his attacks.",
        "tooltip": "Locke readies a set of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Soul Nails</span> to throw, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/48/56/64/72 + (20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and marking enemies hit. Nails apply a 25/25/60% <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> for 1/1/2 seconds, stacking with the amount of nails hit.<br /><br />Attacking the enemy consumes the <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Soul Nails</span>, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(18/26/34/42/50 + (25/27.5/30/32.5/35% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per stack, increased by 20% and 40% for two and three nails respectively.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Each remaining nail refunds (20% ~ 35%) of Ability's Cooldown and Mana cost when this effect ends.</span>",
