      {
        "id": "LockeW",
        "name": "Soul Ignition",
        "description": "Locke ignites his soul, gaining Attack Speed and Move Speed, and dealing damage to himself. At the end of the duration, Locke will heal back a portion of the damage he takes during the effect.",
        "tooltip": "Locke ignites his own soul, gaining <span>(40% ~ 70%) Attack Speed</span> and <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(40% + (0.02% Ability Power)) Move Speed</span> that decays over 2 seconds.<br /><br />For 6 seconds, he suffers <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">2% current Health true damage</span> per second but <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">Heals</span> back the last <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(40/60/80/100/120 + (100% Ability Power))</span> damage taken, and an additional <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(20% Ability Power) Health</span> based on missing Health and time passed, up to a maximum of <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(60% Ability Power) Health remaining</span>.<br /><br />Can be <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> to end early.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability can be used while <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Disabled</span>.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Locke is <span>Ghosted</span> for the duration. Ghosted units can pass through other units.</span>",
