        "description": "Locke teleports to a location before dashing to attack his next target, dealing damage to enemies passed through.",
        "tooltip": "Locke teleports to a location, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/50/60/70/80 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to nearby enemies on arrival. <br /><br />On his next Attack, he dashes to his target, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/60/80/100/120 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to all enemies in his path. Each hit consumes <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Soul Nails</span>.<br /><br />If Locke scores a takedown, the Cooldown of this Ability is reset.",
